The kind lab's run.sh on 2026-10-09 (UTC), from scratch, with cub kubara built from this change,
Kubara v0.15.0, cub v0.8.7 and ConfigHub v0.8.11. PREFIX=rh-kubara, KIND=rhk. argobot v0.1.9 records
live status on each release. After this run, run.sh's section 8 gained a check of why the promotion
was refused, and handover.sh a check of cub's version; the second part below shows that check, and
handover.sh run again on the handed-over hub.


== 1. See what ConfigHub will hold. This needs no account and changes nothing.

$ cub kubara plan platform --prefix rh-kubara
