Once Argo CD syncs the release and dev is Healthy, prod accepts the change:
rh-kubara-metrics-server-hub: release 3 Synced Healthy, reported by argobot

$ cub variant promote --change-order rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/three-replicas --target-stage prod --quiet
Promoting rh-kubara-metrics-server-spoke into stage prod...
