Adding 0 unit(s) from upstream at the change order's start

$ cub variant approve --change-order rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/three-replicas --stage prod
Recorded pass Approval attestation d13d2d9e-d748-42bf-9025-3690c5f7e38d in rh-kubara-metrics-server-spoke, covering 1 revision(s)

$ cub release publish rh-kubara-metrics-server-spoke --revision ChangeOrder:rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/three-replicas --quiet
rh-kubara-metrics-server-spoke: release 3 Synced Healthy, reported by argobot

== 9. A release that breaks dev holds prod back

$ cub function set --space rh-kubara-metrics-server-base --unit metrics-server --change-desc 'An image that does not exist' set-container-image metrics-server registry.k8s.io/metrics-server/metrics-server:v0.0.0-missing --quiet

$ cub function set --space rh-kubara-metrics-server-base --unit metrics-server --change-desc 'Report a stuck rollout after 30 seconds' set-int-path apps/v1/Deployment spec.progressDeadlineSeconds 30 --quiet

$ cub changeorder create --space rh-kubara-metrics-server-base missing-image --change-workflow rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/rollout --description 'An image that does not exist' --allow-exists
Successfully created changeorder missing-image (69b1e1e5-9620-419a-8673-05d2ac89a26a)

$ cub variant promote --change-order rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/missing-image --target-stage dev --quiet
Promoting rh-kubara-metrics-server-hub into stage dev...
Upgraded 1 unit(s) behind their upstream
Adding 0 unit(s) from upstream at the change order's start

$ cub variant approve --change-order rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/missing-image --stage dev
Recorded pass Approval attestation 76f78594-606d-4a48-a44a-e2470fe60d51 in rh-kubara-metrics-server-hub, covering 1 revision(s)

$ cub release publish rh-kubara-metrics-server-hub --revision ChangeOrder:rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/missing-image --quiet
rh-kubara-metrics-server-hub: release 4 Synced Degraded, reported by argobot

$ kubectl --context kind-rhk-hub -n metrics-server get pods
