metrics-server-7c97bf64d6-cs845   1/1     Running        0             2m15s
metrics-server-7c97bf64d6-j7fwr   1/1     Running        1 (17m ago)   31m
metrics-server-7fd4fdd7cb-8z8mw   0/1     ErrImagePull   0             36s

ConfigHub refuses to promote it into prod:

$ cub variant promote --change-order rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/missing-image --target-stage prod --quiet
Failed: Variant 'hub' release 4 is not healthy (Degraded)

Take the change back out, and dev is Healthy again:

$ cub changeorder update --space rh-kubara-metrics-server-base missing-image --aborted-reason 'dev is Degraded: the image does not exist' --quiet

$ cub variant demote --change-order rh-kubara-metrics-server-base/missing-image --quiet
Demoting rh-kubara-metrics-server-hub...
Restored 1 unit(s) to the revisions before change order missing-image
Demoting rh-kubara-metrics-server-base...
Restored 1 unit(s) to the revisions before change order missing-image

$ cub release publish rh-kubara-metrics-server-hub --quiet
rh-kubara-metrics-server-hub: release 5 Synced Healthy, reported by argobot

