== 3/6 Kubara's ApplicationSets read ConfigHub: a change to the argo-cd base
== 4/6 Release each variant, stage by stage: promote, approve, publish
== 5/6 Hand the hub to ConfigHub (your hub cluster)
== 6/6 argobot records each Application's live status on the release it synced
